# Cell from playpick: mode=menus, view=820x1180,touch, save=carried.
#
# No prior menus session (2026-09-25-9, 2026-09-25-19) or any other session
# this job has run has ever opened THE CITADEL map screen -- it needs a walk
# in first, since it is reached from a pad or, mid-evening on touch, by
# revealing the corner group and pressing `map`. Built up in short bursts:
# raid setup -> classpick -> pull -> into the door (a pad, so the corner
# group is already up) -> the map itself -> survey it -> then test README's
# claim that a GIVE UP press on this screen "ends it and puts the next one
# back at the door" against the only button actually on it, BACK.
open
tap raid
tap next
tap class:hunter:marksmanship
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
tap map
targets
shot citadel

# BACK is the only control `targets` finds with nothing cleared yet (RESET
# only appears once down > 0, and there is no GIVE UP anywhere on this
# screen). Press it and see what actually happens to the evening.
tap back
targets
shot after-back
state

# If BACK ended the evening, reopening RAID should land at the door. It
# doesn't -- see direction.md.
open
tap raid
targets
shot raid-reopened
